00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,720
 own and it's not something we're going to talk about a great deal in this

63
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:05,800
 course. But I'd just like you to go forward with a warning. A model which hasn't

64
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:10,360
 been validated shouldn't be used to make predictions or make decisions. People's

65
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:14,200
 lives can depend on this. It's your responsibilities the engineer to come up

